    "Scan of the 1959 edition of the Vernon, Indiana, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1978; field checked in 1959; photo inspected in 1992; photo revised in 1981; last revised in 1994; printed in 1994.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22.1 x 26.9 inches. Printed projection: Transverse Mercator; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
